      "id": "F3",
      "statement": "With pool reuse still enabled, explicit retry-state reset at each request boundary reduced p95 latency from 412 ms to 219 ms and mean retries from 3.1 to 1.0. This directly supports H_retry_state and is not merely the O2 concurrency-relief correlation.",
      "evidence": [
        "E_force_retry_reset",
        "result_hash:6973b14a40f19f51affa6a066311bedf5f1a1f129cc0d2fd1e8fc10b98dbe820"
      ]
