    {
      "id": "F4",
      "statement": "Increasing queue capacity by 4x while holding concurrency and retry policy fixed left p95 latency at 405 ms and mean retries at 3.0, essentially unchanged from baseline 412 ms and 3.1. This directly rejects queue-capacity saturation as the primary mechanism.",
